{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23250","headline":"病中对病鹤 · 白居易","name":"病中对病鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同病病夫怜病鹤，精神不损翅翎伤。\n未堪再举摩霄汉，只合相随觅稻粱。\n但作悲吟和嘹唳，难将俗貌对昂藏。\n唯应一事宜爲伴，我发君毛俱似霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}